# {{ site.name | ascii | safe }}

> {{ site.summary | ascii | safe }}

Built with Bootstrap 5 and FontAwesome 6. Every page below is available as
Markdown -- fetch these `.md` URLs rather than the rendered HTML pages, which
are roughly 90% navigation chrome.

Guidance pages are prose. Reference pages are generated from the live
documentation pages and carry each component's real markup in fenced `html`
blocks, so they cannot drift from what the site renders. Each names its
rendered counterpart in a `source:` front matter field.

When copying from a reference page, take the component element itself and drop
the surrounding `.row` / `.col-*` wrappers -- those lay the demo out beside its
description and are not part of the component.

Colours, spacing, and type are Bootstrap 5 variables overridden with UChicago
brand tokens. Prefer Bootstrap's own classes and the documented component
classes over bespoke CSS.

